1. (a) The vessel licence must be renewed annually and the vessel must record landings at least every second year.
(b)	No. (c) Not available.
2.	(a) 1972, 5046; 1973, 4996; 1974, 4823; 1975, 4775;
1976,	4700; 1977, 4703; (b) 1972, 390; 1973, 441; 1974, 419;
1975,	467; 1976, 446; 1977, 445. (c) 1972, $216,600; 1973, $946,500; 1974, $936,800; 1975, $921,800; 1976, $918,400;
1977,	$917,300.
3.	"B" licences were available to salmon fishing vessels that recorded landings in 1967 or 1968 but did not meet the required level of landings to quality for an "A" licence.
4.	(a) 1972, 897; 1973, 934; 1974, 697; 1975, 642; 1976, 623; 1977, 597. (b) Indian licences are designated as Indian "A" licences. Indian fishermen do not take out "B" licences.
(c)	1972, $1,600; 1973, $7,340; 1974, $6,970; 1975, $6,420;
1976,	$6,230; 1977, $5,970.
